cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these materials, please cite the paper and this repository."
type: dataset
title: "Reproducibility materials for Local Source Visibility in Generative Search"
abstract: >-
  Coded source records, paired coder values, codebook, and a script to recalculate
  descriptive results for a paired audit of English and Filipino local-information
  queries in Philippine cities. Includes the preserved initial P01-P08 reliability
  pass and dated project-lead adjudication materials. Version 1.2.0 uses consistent
  within-cell URL grouping and observed citation matches in incomplete captures.
authors:
  - family-names: Dorado
    given-names: Dan Anthony
repository-code: "https://github.com/dddorado/information-friction-reproducibility"
version: "1.2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-16"
